1
00:01:22,720 --> 00:01:24,280
[Isn't it thrilling?]

2
00:01:25,520 --> 00:01:26,640
[I think so.]

3
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:29,280
[Do you know?]

4
00:01:29,640 --> 00:01:30,400
[An avalanche]

5
00:01:30,680 --> 00:01:32,760
[starts with a single snowflake.]

6
00:01:50,840 --> 00:01:51,880
You're here.

7
00:01:53,240 --> 00:01:54,280
I'm waiting for you.

8
00:01:55,080 --> 00:01:56,560
Sister Qianqian, you look gorgeous today.

9
00:01:56,800 --> 00:01:58,080
You look like a bride.

10
00:01:58,960 --> 00:02:00,120
You're so sweet.

11
00:02:02,840 --> 00:02:03,600
Take a break.

12
00:02:03,760 --> 00:02:04,440
I'll call you later.

13
00:02:04,640 --> 00:02:05,480
Yes, Miss Lu.

14
00:02:10,600 --> 00:02:11,080
Hey,

15
00:02:12,440 --> 00:02:13,520
what's going on with you?

16
00:02:13,920 --> 00:02:15,880
It's my wedding day,

17
00:02:16,160 --> 00:02:17,880
and you look even more stressed than I do.

18
00:02:18,440 --> 00:02:19,320
Something happened at the company?

19
00:02:19,320 --> 00:02:20,520
Just a few things

20
00:02:20,520 --> 00:02:21,720
that need to be dealt with.

21
00:02:24,400 --> 00:02:25,360
It's okay.

22
00:02:25,560 --> 00:02:26,400
Don't frown.

23
00:02:26,520 --> 00:02:27,440
If something bad happens,

24
00:02:27,760 --> 00:02:28,600
I'll take care of it.

25
00:02:29,080 --> 00:02:30,960
I'm gonna wear the wedding dress you designed

26
00:02:31,040 --> 00:02:32,360
to be the most beautiful bride.

27
00:02:33,240 --> 00:02:34,400
The bride is the most important person today.

28
00:02:34,560 --> 00:02:35,160
I'll do whatever you want.

29
00:02:37,880 --> 00:02:38,320
Hello.

30
00:02:38,960 --> 00:02:39,800
Okay, I'm coming.

31
00:02:42,160 --> 00:02:43,480
I have to go out for something urgent.

32
00:04:09,520 --> 00:04:10,680
Miss Lu Qianqian.

33
00:04:10,960 --> 00:04:12,120
Miss Lu Qianqian.

34
00:04:17,520 --> 00:04:18,720
Miss Lu Qianqian.

35
00:04:22,760 --> 00:04:24,000
Miss Lu Qianqian.

36
00:04:32,840 --> 00:04:33,280
Qianqian,

37
00:04:34,160 --> 00:04:34,720
are you okay?

38
00:04:35,320 --> 00:04:35,920
Are you

39
00:04:36,080 --> 00:04:37,080
feeling unwell?

40
00:04:38,200 --> 00:04:39,000
I'm fine.

41
00:04:40,480 --> 00:04:41,640
I just stayed up too late last night,

42
00:04:42,400 --> 00:04:43,240
so I'm a bit groggy.

43
00:04:44,920 --> 00:04:46,000
Miss Lu Qianqian,

44
00:04:46,240 --> 00:04:48,440
do you take Mr. Zhou Jian to be your lawful wedded husband?

45
00:04:48,720 --> 00:04:51,960
For better or for worse,

46
00:04:52,120 --> 00:04:53,240
in sickness and in health,

47
00:04:53,400 --> 00:04:54,160
to love, honor and cherish him,

48
00:04:54,320 --> 00:04:55,840
and to be his loving haven

49
00:04:56,280 --> 00:04:58,160
until death do you part?

50
00:05:03,960 --> 00:05:04,800
I

51
00:05:08,720 --> 00:05:09,600
do.

52
00:05:14,240 --> 00:05:15,280
Now,

53
00:05:15,280 --> 00:05:17,120
let's welcome our lovely angel

54
00:05:17,200 --> 00:05:18,160
to present the rings

55
00:05:18,160 --> 00:05:20,000
[to the newlyweds.]

56
00:05:27,280 --> 00:05:28,680
You're late to your sister's wedding.

57
00:05:29,480 --> 00:05:31,000
Is it because you haven't been home?

58
00:05:31,000 --> 00:05:32,360
and have been hanging out outside?

59
00:05:33,360 --> 00:05:34,520
Are you spying on me?

60
00:05:35,960 --> 00:05:37,760
You're the most eye-catching wherever you go.

61
00:05:37,760 --> 00:05:39,120
Do I need to spy on you?

62
00:05:39,320 --> 00:05:40,640
[This small ring]

63
00:05:40,640 --> 00:05:42,600
[has no beginning and no end,]

64
00:05:42,960 --> 00:05:46,560
[symbolizing your eternal and complete commitment to each other.]

65
00:05:58,160 --> 00:05:58,920
Now,

66
00:05:59,040 --> 00:06:00,600
please exchange rings

67
00:06:02,560 --> 00:06:05,480
and lock in your promise of happiness.

68
00:06:52,720 --> 00:06:54,360
What did you do to my sister?

69
00:06:54,640 --> 00:06:56,240
She looks very abnormal.

70
00:06:56,280 --> 00:06:56,800
At this moment,

71
00:06:56,800 --> 00:06:58,240
the ring finger is no longer nameless.

72
00:06:58,680 --> 00:06:59,920
She just saw clearly

73
00:06:59,920 --> 00:07:02,240
what was crawling under that gorgeous satin.

74
00:07:02,240 --> 00:07:03,480
Please join hands

75
00:07:03,480 --> 00:07:04,760
and raise your glasses together

76
00:07:04,960 --> 00:07:06,560
with all your loved ones

77
00:07:06,560 --> 00:07:09,360
and share this sweetness and happiness.

78
00:07:38,040 --> 00:07:38,840
Sister.

79
00:07:39,480 --> 00:07:40,520
Brother-in-law.

80
00:07:41,480 --> 00:07:42,320
How are you?

81
00:07:43,080 --> 00:07:44,640
It's such a big day today.

82
00:07:45,800 --> 00:07:46,840
Are you happy?

83
00:07:55,000 --> 00:07:55,840
You...

84
00:08:08,680 --> 00:08:09,120
Qianqian.

85
00:08:11,440 --> 00:08:12,280
The guests are still here.

86
00:08:21,560 --> 00:08:22,600
Are you done?

87
00:08:23,400 --> 00:08:24,360
Miss Lu,

88
00:08:42,280 --> 00:08:43,520
your mouth is bleeding. Wipe it.

89
00:08:51,280 --> 00:08:52,800
I'll wait for you at the wedding dress store.

90
00:09:07,480 --> 00:09:08,560
You just finished the ceremony.

91
00:09:08,560 --> 00:09:10,200
Why are you hiding here alone?

92
00:09:10,560 --> 00:09:11,440
Where's your husband?

93
00:09:28,960 --> 00:09:30,240
You finally saw it.

94
00:09:31,240 --> 00:09:32,160
I was thinking

95
00:09:32,160 --> 00:09:33,480
of finding a suitable time

96
00:09:33,480 --> 00:09:34,240
to tell you.

97
00:09:40,080 --> 00:09:41,160
1%.

98
00:09:42,640 --> 00:09:43,440
Sign it,

99
00:09:44,120 --> 00:09:46,120
and the 1% of shares will be yours.

100
00:09:47,080 --> 00:09:48,240
The condition is,

101
00:09:50,960 --> 00:09:53,240
before I come back from abroad,

102
00:09:53,520 --> 00:09:55,520
I don't care how you do it,

103
00:09:56,080 --> 00:09:58,160
just get rid of all the women

104
00:09:58,160 --> 00:09:59,280
related to Zhou Jian.

105
00:10:00,320 --> 00:10:01,320
I don't want

106
00:10:01,520 --> 00:10:03,120
any trouble afterwards.

107
00:10:33,720 --> 00:10:34,280
Yan,

108
00:10:35,000 --> 00:10:37,440
take out the autumn clothes from my cloakroom,

109
00:10:37,680 --> 00:10:38,320
iron them, and tidy them up.

110
00:10:39,160 --> 00:10:40,560
Then find two pairs of shoes

111
00:10:40,560 --> 00:10:41,680
and put them in the suitcase.

112
00:10:42,120 --> 00:10:43,080
Yes, ma'am.

113
00:11:03,400 --> 00:11:04,760
You're leaving early tomorrow morning?

114
00:11:05,920 --> 00:11:06,640
Is it that urgent?

115
00:11:11,800 --> 00:11:12,440
Yeah.

116
00:11:13,240 --> 00:11:14,440
The plane tickets are booked.

117
00:11:23,640 --> 00:11:25,040
Why do you suddenly go to Singapore?

118
00:11:25,640 --> 00:11:26,520
I never

119
00:11:26,760 --> 00:11:28,000
heard you mention it before.

120
00:11:35,920 --> 00:11:36,880
I'm gonna meet an old friend.

121
00:11:37,560 --> 00:11:39,800
I'm afraid you're too busy to go with me,

122
00:11:40,160 --> 00:11:41,720
so I'll go for two days by myself.

123
00:11:42,120 --> 00:11:43,040
I'll be back soon.

124
00:11:43,520 --> 00:11:44,320
Qianqian,

125
00:11:45,400 --> 00:11:46,480
what happened to you today?

126
00:11:55,400 --> 00:11:56,200
I'm full.

127
00:12:01,240 --> 00:12:02,680
Why did you hit Lu Xu?

128
00:12:10,880 --> 00:12:12,560
I'm going to rest.

129
00:12:54,320 --> 00:12:55,120
Miss Lu,

130
00:12:55,320 --> 00:12:57,000
that's the Ms. Li you're looking for.

131
00:12:57,400 --> 00:12:58,320
Thank you.

132
00:13:16,560 --> 00:13:17,920
Hello, Dean Li.

133
00:13:18,120 --> 00:13:19,320
I'm Lu Qianqian,

134
00:13:19,520 --> 00:13:20,600
coming from abroad.

135
00:13:21,160 --> 00:13:22,760
I'm sorry to bother you.

136
00:13:22,760 --> 00:13:24,160
I know who you are.

137
00:13:26,160 --> 00:13:27,360
You know me?

138
00:13:28,040 --> 00:13:30,400
You are the child of Lu Jingcheng and Yu Wen.

139
00:13:31,240 --> 00:13:32,400
You must have remembered wrong.

140
00:13:32,960 --> 00:13:34,600
Lu Jingcheng is my father,

141
00:13:34,960 --> 00:13:36,040
but my mother

142
00:13:36,360 --> 00:13:37,680
is called Annie.
